",\"title\":\"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC10837049/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d29\"},\"ref\":\"d29\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Locals by Jonathan Dee\\n\\nJonathan Dee is the author of six previous novels, most recently A Thousand Pardons. His novel The Privileges was a finalist for the 2011 Pulitzer Prize and winner of the 2011 Prix Fitzgerald and the St. Francis College Literary Prize. A former contributing ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.aspeninstitute.org/blog-posts/20-new-works-fiction-social-impact/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d44\"},\"ref\":\"d44\",\"snippet\":\" ... Cloud Atlas won the British Book Awards Literary Fiction Award and was shortlisted for the Booker Prize, the Nebula Award for Best Novel and the Arthur C. Clarke Award.\\n\\nThe novel was made into a movie in 2012, directed by Tom Tykwer, Lana Wachowski and Lilly Wachowski, starring ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.cbc.ca/books/30-books-to-celebrate-30-years-of-writers-company-1.5755144\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"bffc79efd774bd80e51002e9632d6a090eae281f7d9beeb1b1db60959e91e482\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"4ae59db4bbf9a6c7b736f297632e0f3cce425df5ed05f381db313d18832514f1\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize 2010 2011 2012 2013 winner shortlisted novels\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_3fe15313e8264ea49e42373e"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle. The Man Asian Literary Prize (2007) is a strong candidate. Let me look at its Wikipedia page directly to understand the winners and shortlist structure.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize winners shortlist 2010 2011 2012 2013\"], \"top_k\": 8}","name":"search"},"id":"call_6bab4e5f34874b26aa2b2f42","index":0,"type":"function"}]},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d26\"},\"ref\":\"d26\",\"snippet\":\" ... Akutagawa Prize - Wikipedia\\nauthor: Authority control databases National France BnF data Japan\\ndate: 2004-01-20\\n---\\nname: Akutagawa Prize\\nsubheader: 芥川龍之介賞 (Akutagawa Ryūnosuke Shō)\\nawarded_for: Best published literary story by a rising author\\npresenter: Society for the Promotion of Japanese Literature\\ncountry: Japan\\ndate: 10 08 1935 ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Akutagawa_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... A Russian version of the Booker Prize was created in 1992 called the Booker-Open Russia Literary Prize, also known as the Russian Booker Prize. In 2007, Man Group plc established the Man Asian Literary Prize, an annual literary award given to the best novel by an Asian ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d45\"},\"ref\":\"d45\",\"snippet\":\" ... The Asian/Pacific American Awards for Literature are administered by the Asian/Pacific American Librarians Association to honor outstanding literary works by or about Asian/Pacific Americans. Books in various genres written by or about Asian/Pacific Americans are eligible.\\n\