e and the Newman Prize ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.brianhaman.com/writing/yan-lianke-interview\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... 2012\\n\\nLevy's Swimming Home made it to the 2012 Man Booker Prize shortlist, relaunching her career. Delighted readers send us presents, including a set of coloured spoons.\\n\\n2013\\n\\nWe set up office in the US, run initially by Sarah Russo, and started publicising and publishing many of ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.andotherstories.org/about-us/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d60\"},\"ref\":\"d60\",\"snippet\":\" ... Daljit Nagra's prize-winning Look We Have Coming to Dover! and his follow-up Tippoo Sultan's Incredible White-Man-Eating Tiger Toy-Machine!!!, both rarities on Faber's list, depict British Asians with enthusiastic racialized self-mockery (note the increasing exclamation marks). Voiced in the hysterics ... \",\"title\":\"https://lareviewofbooks.org/article/not-a-british-subject-race-and-poetry-in-the-uk\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"1ea69ffa1dd7883a5df8b229319de3fd2fdf455a06b13ee831257faab7f1cbe6\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"cca9842624cd79392fde1a022659caed2e73cdf37301ab90b3f411ef2cc8d6ff\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Man Asian Literary Prize 2012 shortlist Between Clay and Dust\",\"view\":\"full\"},{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d23\"},\"ref\":\"d23\",\"snippet\":\" ... International IMPAC Dublin Lit