s_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d81\"},\"ref\":\"d81\",\"snippet\":\" ... In 2019, he was writer-in-residence at the Jan Michalski Foundation in Switzerland, where he worked on his third novel. He is currently on a 14-month, 49-state road trip in his 1979 VW bus, while he and his wife, Miracle, produce a podcast called \\\"So ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.writersdigest.com/wd-competitions/announcing-the-winners-of-the-90th-annual-writers-digest-writing-competition\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d30\"},\"ref\":\"d30\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her debut novel We That Are Young won the 2018 Desmond Elliott Prize and was also nominated for international awards including the Rathbones Folio Prize, the Jan Michalski Prize and the Shakti Bhatt First Book Award. It was a Book of the Decade in The Hindu, a top ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.andotherstories.org/about-us/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"b3a0874c060a39f62e14aefa4ed1f017f35aa34bfa76dea3e664a9e08db39f3a\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"0ba0d5f2b053b5e8d97f5ac4059098cc25f9b6044e82c1472210557d4eac5fb4\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"Jan Michalski Prize Wikipedia\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_f7331b23afce4a04b9535d15"},{"content":"Let me reconsider the puzzle structure carefully. The key constraint is \"an award originally created in the 2000s.\" Let me think about awards created in the 2000s and look at the Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia page directly.","role":"assistant","tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"queries\": [\"Man Asian Literary Prize Wikipedia\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2012 shortlist Between Clay and Dust\", \"Man Asian Literary Prize 2011 201